resources.string:
Without Tor the app connects to the AEGIS server directly over HTTPS. Encryption of messages and calls stays the same — what changes is what others see:

• your provider will see that you connect to the AEGIS server;
• the server will see your IP address and can match it with your mailbox addresses, i.e. indirectly learn who talks to whom;
• in calls the peer will see your IP address.

The built-in Tor does not start at all in this mode.
